<title>GERMANY: Hoechst unit to raise polyester prices.</title>
<headline>Hoechst unit to raise polyester prices.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoechst Diafoil, a unit of German chemicals and drugs firm Hoechst AG said on Tuesday that it planned to raise its prices of polyester sheeting by up to 10 percent as of the beginning of June.</p>
<p>The unit said in a statement that the hike would serve to counter a recent price decline and expected higher costs in the first and second quarter of this year.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
